    "These are reused-dependency build/render observations, not fixed-schedule scaling, AB/BA or speedup evidence.",
    "Earlier exploratory logs are retained for diagnosis; only explicitly paired source records support current-source validation. Review attempt patch bases are listed individually; the first diagnostic failure counted earlier strict-reader probes rather than only probes after refusal.",
